  "question": {
    "text": "Which of the following is/are correct for the first order reaction?<br />\r<img src=\"assets\\qt0042_689626512936.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:5.59375in;height:1.48681in\" />"
